#. module: account_payment_term_paid
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:account_payment_term_paid.field_account_payment_term__already_paid
msgid "Already Paid"
msgstr "Già pagato"

#. module: account_payment_term_paid
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_payment_term_paid.field_account_payment_term__already_paid
msgid ""
"If checked, invoices using this payment term are treated as already settled "
"and no payment info (e.g. bank account) is set."
msgstr ""
"Se selezionato, le fatture che utilizzano questo termine di pagamento "
"vengono considerate già saldate e non viene impostata alcuna informazione "
"di pagamento (ad es. il conto bancario)."

